{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:KnotsParticlesConfinement.StableAtomDecidable","@type":"LeanModule","name":"KnotsParticlesConfinement.StableAtomDecidable","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.ParticleInteractions.AtomKnot"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.StableAtom.decidable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.StableAtom.decidable","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/stable-atom-decidable.lean#L36-L46","doc":"**Stability is decidable.**\n\nFor any atom-knot K and q in the generic locus, `feasible` is\ncomputable: NF reduction terminates (Diamond Lemma), confinement\nlevel is finite, and ILP feasibility in fixed dimension is\ndecidable by Lenstra's theorem.  The `StableAtom` predicate is\ntherefore inhabited for every `(K, q)`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:stable-atom-decidable","label":"prop:stable-atom-decidable","md":"quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/stable-atom-decidable.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.StableAtom.feasible","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.StableAtom.feasible","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/stable-atom-decidable.lean#L34-L34","doc":"Boolean: ILP feasible at q. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.StableAtom.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.StableAtom.q","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/stable-atom-decidable.lean#L32-L32","doc":"Substrate parameter. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.StableAtom.knot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.StableAtom.knot","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/stable-atom-decidable.lean#L30-L30","doc":"The atom-knot. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.StableAtom.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.StableAtom.mk","kind":"ctor","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/stable-atom-decidable.lean#L28-L28","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.StableAtom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.StableAtom","kind":"structure","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/stable-atom-decidable.lean#L23-L34","doc":"**Stable atom predicate** at substrate parameter `q : R`\n(faithful copy of `def:stable-atom`).\n\nRecords ILP feasibility of the Frobenius positivity constraints in\nthe confinement filtration `J^ℓ(q)`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:stable-atom","label":"def:stable-atom","md":"quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/stable-atom.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}